    thinking: "**Considering Additional Packages**\n\nI\'m currently exploring useful supplemental packages. I\'m considering `canvas-confetti` for celebratory animations, and am also looking at `recharts`, `clsx`, and `tailwind-merge` if the project needs them. I\'ll install `canvas-confetti` and its types if I decide to go that route, but I\'m also considering custom options. Finally, I\'m checking if `multer` is necessary.\n\n\n**Evaluating Data Handling**\n\nI\'ve been thinking about how to handle image uploads. I\'m leaning toward base64 JSON payloads sent via Express with `body-parser`. It seems clean, fast, and avoids extra dependencies. I\'m exploring whether this approach aligns well with the required features, especially given the need for a user-friendly upload mechanism. I\'m considering the potential impact on processing and performance compared to other methods like `multer`.\n\n\n"
