-500/20\'> Start Classification </button> </nav> <main class=\'flex flex-1 p-8 gap-8 items-start overflow-hidden\'> <section class=\'flex flex-col gap-8 w-[580px] h-full shrink-0\'> <div class=\'space-y-4\'> <h1 class=\'text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.1]\'> Identify Any <span class=\'bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-purple-400 to-pink-400\'>Animal</span> with AI </h1> <p class=\'text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-md leading-relaxed\'> Upload an animal image and let our Deep Learning model identify its species in seconds with professional precision. </p> </div> <div class=\'flex gap-4\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 w-32\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-1\'>Accuracy</span> <span class=\'text-2xl font-bold\'>94.7%</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 w-32\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-1\'>Speed</span> <span class=\'text-2xl font-bold\'>&lt; 2s</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 w-32\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-1\'>Classes</span> <span class=\'text-2xl font-bold\'>10+</span> </div> </div> <div class=\'relative group flex-1\'> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500/10 to-purple-500/10 rounded-3xl blur-xl opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity\'></div> <div class=\'relative h-full border-2 border-dashed border-zinc-700 bg-zinc-900/50 rounded-3xl flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-12 transition-colors hover:border-indigo-500/50 group-hover:bg-zinc-900/80 cursor-pointer\'> <div class=\'w-16 h-16 bg-zinc-800 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\'> <svg class=\'w-8 h-8 text-indigo-400\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'currentColor\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\'><path stroke-linecap=\'round\' stroke-linejoin=\'round\' stroke-width=\'2\' d=\'=\'></path></svg> </div> <h3 class=\'text-xl font-semibold mb-2\'>Upload Animal Image</h3> <p class=\'text-zinc-500 text-sm mb-6\'>Drag and drop or browse (JPG, PNG, WEBP)</p> <button class=\'px-8 py-3 bg-white text-black rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-zinc-200 transition-colors\'> Analyze Image </button> </div> </div> </section> <section class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6 h-full\'> <div class=\'p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-800 to-zinc-900 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl shrink-0\'> <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between mb-8\'> <h2 class=\'text-zinc-400 text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest\'>Prediction Result</h2> <span class=\'px-3 py-1 bg-green-500/10 text-green-400 text-[10px] font-bold rounded-full border border-green-500/20\'>Live Analysis</span> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-8 mb-8\'> <div class=\'w-28 h-28 bg-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-6xl shadow-inner border border-white/5\'> \360\237\246\201 </div> <div class=\'flex-1\'> <h4 class=\'text-zinc-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase mb-1\'>Top Prediction</h4> <div class=\'text-4xl font-bold mb-2\'>African Lion</div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-3\'> <div class=\'h-2.5 flex-1 bg-zinc-700 rounded-full overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 w-[94.7%] rounded-full\'></div> </div> <span class=\'text-lg font-mono text-indigo-400\'>94.72%</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'space-y-4\'> <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between text-sm\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-300\'>Bengal Tiger</span> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 w-1/2\'> <div class=\'h-1.5 flex-1 bg-zinc-700/50 rounded-full overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'h-full bg-zinc-500 w-[3.2%] rounded-full\'></div> </div> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 w-10 text-right\'>3.21%</span> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between text-sm\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-300\'>African Leopard</span> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 w-1/2\'> <div class=\'h-1.5 flex-1 bg-zinc-700/50 rounded-full overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'h-full bg-zinc-500 w-[1.1%] rounded-full\'></div> </div> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 w-10 text-right\'>1.14%</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex-1 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-zinc-900/50 border border-white/5 flex flex-col overflow-hidden\'> <h2 class=\'text-zinc-400 text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest mb-4\'>Model Intelligence Dashboard</h2> <div class=\'grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 flex-1\'> <div class=\'p-4 bg-black/40 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-center\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\'>Architecture</span> <span class=\'text-sm font-semibold\'>EfficientNetB0</span> </div> <div class=\'p-4 bg-black/40 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-center\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\'>Framework</span> <span class=\'text-sm font-semibold\'>TF / Keras</span> </div> <div class=\'p-4 bg-black/40 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-center\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\'>Input Size</span> <span class=\'text-sm font-semibold\'>224 \303\227 224</span> </div> <div class=\'p-4 bg-black/40 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 flex flex-col justify-center\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase\'>Training</span> <span class=\'text-sm font-semibold\'>Transfer Learning</span> </div> <div class=\'col-span-2 p-4 bg-black/40 rounded-2xl border border-white/5\'> <span class=\'text-zinc-500 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase mb-2 block\'>Processing Pipeline</span> <div class=\'flex justify-between items-center text-[10px] font-mono\'> <span>Input</span> <span>\342\206\222</span> <span class=\'text-indigo-400\'>Preproc</span> <span>\342\206\222</span> <span class=\'text-indigo-400\'>EfficientNet</span> <span>\342\206\222</span> <span class=\'text-indigo-400\'>Softmax</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> </main> <footer class=\'h-12 border-t border-white/5 flex items-center px-10 justify-between text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-zinc-600 bg-black/20\'> <span>&copy; 2024 AnimalAI Research Lab</span> <span>System Status: Optimal</span> <span>v2.1.0 Stable Build</span> </footer> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
